    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the dream world is complicated\u2026 it's a world filled with both long lost friends, and nightmares. Equipped with your handy umbrella, you must steel your nerves to navigate and explore this treacherously surreal world\u2014 molded by remnants of your shaky past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Tight, Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memoria Wake</strong> blends classic isometric exploration with souls-like parry-focused combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your timing and technique to parry enemy attacks,\u00a0turning their strength against them with finesse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/4cab1b7571498cee4336ea8b0e4b2160.poster.avif?t=1754342792\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/4cab1b7571498cee4336ea8b0e4b2160.webm?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/4cab1b7571498cee4336ea8b0e4b2160.mp4?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on sharp reflexes and quick thinking as you dash and jab your way through unrelenting nightmares using a diverse arsenal of tools and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/a2abdb4f954e946cab6b84cb88f4daca.poster.avif?t=1754342792\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/a2abdb4f954e946cab6b84cb88f4daca.webm?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/a2abdb4f954e946cab6b84cb88f4daca.mp4?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Fragmented Dream</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse hand-crafted dreamscapes where beauty and horror intertwine. Uncover long buried truths, face twisted memories, and piece together the fragments of a broken past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/d421fe70e6deadfd83f442e7fa28f283.poster.avif?t=1754342792\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/d421fe70e6deadfd83f442e7fa28f283.webm?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/d421fe70e6deadfd83f442e7fa28f283.mp4?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel a Deep, Emotional Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nilo\u2019s journey is personal. The further you push through the world, the closer you get to uncovering the mystery of a long broken bond\u2014but some memories don't want to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/c1faad18c2aa56553706928139d2ecf2.poster.avif?t=1754342792\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/c1faad18c2aa56553706928139d2ecf2.webm?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/c1faad18c2aa56553706928139d2ecf2.mp4?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Will you chase what can\u2019t be undone? Even fading memories leave a mark. Find them before they\u2019re gone.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring the dream world is complicated\u2026 it's a world filled with both long lost friends, and nightmares. Equipped with your handy umbrella, you must steel your nerves to navigate and explore this treacherously surreal world\u2014 molded by remnants of your shaky past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Tight, Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memoria Wake</strong> blends classic isometric exploration with souls-like parry-focused combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your timing and technique to parry enemy attacks,\u00a0turning their strength against them with finesse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/4cab1b7571498cee4336ea8b0e4b2160.poster.avif?t=1754342792\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/4cab1b7571498cee4336ea8b0e4b2160.webm?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/4cab1b7571498cee4336ea8b0e4b2160.mp4?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on sharp reflexes and quick thinking as you dash and jab your way through unrelenting nightmares using a diverse arsenal of tools and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/a2abdb4f954e946cab6b84cb88f4daca.poster.avif?t=1754342792\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240610/extras/a2abdb4f954e946cab6b84cb88f4daca.webm?t=1754342792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v